      "text": "content: 'Designated narrative:\n\n  Heavy rain on Tuesday flooded the northern seedbeds at Lakeview community garden.\n  The gardeners dug a shallow channel to drain the standing water. They moved unused\n  seed packets into a dry shed and checked the damaged plants the next morning. By\n  Friday they had replanted the beds and saved thirty-six of the forty lettuce plants.'\nfilename: designated-narrative.txt\nid_: '1'\nlast_modified: 2026-01-02 12:00:00\nowner: fixture@example.com\nshared_with: {}\nsize: 352",
